From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 02:59:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm: apple: dcp: End the sink modes waits on a crash too

Commit dfbb9f87da42 ("drm: apple: Bound modeset retries, fence hotplug
work across suspend and serialise the release") wakes the publication
waiters from dcp_rtk_crashed(), but only the wait in dcp_poweron()
tests crashed. dcp_publish_wait_done(), used by the sink modes work,
does not, so after a crash that work still sleeps the full
DCP_PUBLISH_TIMEOUT before it notices.

Test crashed in dcp_publish_wait_done() as well.

Fixes: dfbb9f87da42 ("drm: apple: Bound modeset retries, fence hotplug work across suspend and serialise the release")
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UqitcmCNS6G33aQUShi39x
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp.c
index 3d74ec6..7644cb6 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp.c
@@ -716,7 +716,7 @@ static void _dcp_poweron(struct apple_dcp *dcp, bool open_client)
 static bool dcp_publish_wait_done(struct apple_dcp *dcp, u32 seq)
 {
 	return READ_ONCE(dcp->publish_seq) != seq || READ_ONCE(dcp->powered) ||
-	       READ_ONCE(dcp->stopping);
+	       READ_ONCE(dcp->stopping) || READ_ONCE(dcp->crashed);
 }
 
 static void dcp_wake_publish_waiters(struct apple_dcp *dcp)
